{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "crepus",
 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "CREPUS",
 "description": "CREPUS for the Digitone mk1 (OS 1.44): a macro-only one-knob tilt / DJ filter guest pack. One master page and one right-edge depth bar. A toggles the filter, D cycles six response modes (TILT, DAWN, NOON, DUSK, ECLIPSE, UMBRA), B/C/E/F/G/H edit the amount. The amount is centred at 64: turning below 64 tilts the master dark (low shelf up, high shelf down, resonant low-pass sweep), turning above 64 tilts it bright (low shelf down, high shelf up, high-pass sweep). TILT is the pure two-shelf EQ motion; ECLIPSE is a moving resonant band. The page draws an encoder-driven full-screen sun/moon dial: the moon rises as the sun sets, with pulsating stars between them; OFF scrolls the CREPUS wordmark on the 4 px dot lattice with the depth bar visible. State is stored per pattern in the reserved CH 15 MIDI-track block (pattern+0x1800, magic ESO7). Requires core 4.0 and the ESOTERIKA page host; includes neither.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk1",
  "product": "Digitone mk1",
  "os": "1.44",
  "syx_sha256": "d4f200d04484333d82822db7744e6484d0def8f2db8ddf55ee2b780cc13c9659",
